{
  "bookId": "rewind-35",
  "id": "chapter-137",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称；|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32501001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "告诉我，你们对夏天的想象是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32501002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "蝉鸣，沙滩，热烈的阳光，无垠的碧海……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32501003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "当然，还有寄宿了夏日的热情与幻想的泳装。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32501004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "而这所有的一切，都将出现在这场赛事里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32501005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "在这盛夏的舞台——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32501006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "成为最强的斗士吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在一个平凡的夏日的上午——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "嘿嘿，你是在找什么人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "我们可非常熟悉这片地方，需要带路吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我认识你们吗？快给我让开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "当然可以让开……如果你能给我们一点过路费的话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "哎，没想到我也会有被人打劫的一天。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "既然送上门来，就别怪我不客气啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "怎么突然摆出个唬人的架势……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "这可是一打三，建议你先想想清楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "谜之少女",
          "text": "请、请住手！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "啊，猎物增加了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "看上去比现在这个还要好欺负。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "谜之少女",
          "text": "……我只是一个路过的准高中生，你们的作恶就到此为止了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "虽然有点不清楚状况……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "但来得正好，我们一起上吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "老大，怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32502018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "啧，动手！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "说是一起上……感觉都没有什么插手的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "发生什么事了，她怎么这么能打？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "碰上硬茬了，我们撤退！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "啊啊，真倒霉啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "打不过就跑吗？真是差劲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "刚才多谢了，我是人称「千裂苍龙」的绿子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "谜之少女",
          "text": "这是到自报名号的经典环节了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "谜之少女",
          "text": "我是仓田流古武术的仓田真乃，叫我真乃就可以啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503009",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "仓田真乃 · 湛蓝晨星\n商品名称：仓田真乃·湛蓝晨星 Ver.\n作品出处：《格斗学园》\n制造商：GALATEA 伽拉\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约225mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "难怪这么厉害，原来是仓田流啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32503011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "等下，仓田流？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-722",
