      ],
      "title": "英雄登场·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32504001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "仓田……是我知道的那个仓田吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "请问有什么奇怪的地方吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "仓田龙马和你是什么关系？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊，他……是仓田家本家的继承人，我的堂哥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "什么？堂哥？也就是说——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "会长居然有个这么可爱的堂妹，我怎么从来没听说过！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊哈哈哈……怎么当面说人家可爱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "他确实是我的堂哥，只是从很小的时候起就没见过面了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "应该早就不记得我了吧……我对他也只有模糊的印象。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "这样啊……明明是兄妹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我是西本高中学生会的副会长，龙马的话是会长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哦哦，在原来的世界，我也快就读西本高中了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "其实……我刚才是在寻找龙马，他失踪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "失踪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "也不知道是什么时候起不见了，反应过来已经好几个星期没联系过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "无论是去住处，还是去他常去的地方都没有找到人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "该不会是卷入了什么麻烦里吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "被当地的混混手办寻仇……意外撞见邪恶组织的幕后交易……被来自未来的人造人手办追杀……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "情况确实很不妙……但如果是堂哥的话，应该什么都能应付。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "可是，这真的很让人担心啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不要急，我也来帮忙，和你一起去找。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "好，接下来……我们去找主人商量吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "主人？是绿子的主人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "你没见过|102|吗，那个总是关心手办的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32504026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-723",
