      "title": "英雄登场·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32505001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "仓田龙马的……堂妹？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "是的，我是仓田家的分家，龙马属于本家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "本家和分家有什么区别吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "区别的话……是有一些的。本家的地位会比分家高一点，大人间的关系也比较糟糕。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "所以，我和堂哥的关系挺疏远的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "先不追问仓田家的家务事了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我们需要你的帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在绿子的讲述下，主人得知了龙马失踪的事。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "他失踪前有什么值得注意的迹象吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "之前见到他的时候不是在练武，就是在冥想，实在没什么异常的地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "噢，我想起来了，他曾经很认真地看手里的一份海报。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那是什么样的海报？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "好像是什么夏季嘉年华的宣传海报，我没注意看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "32505015",
              "text": "夏季嘉年华？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "32505015",
              "text": "宣传海报？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "32505014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "之前听说管理局在举办夏日活动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "游乐园那一带确实很热闹的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "会长的失踪，会和这个有关系吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "从这里入手调查吧，可以先联系下管理局。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "一提到管理局，就是管理局的来电？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "慢着，不是阿尔弗雷德？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505022",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "久疏问候，|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32505023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为什么联络人是你？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-724",
